Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.98,0:00:04.23,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.23,0:00:07.90,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You and Sion were scouted for the Prodigy Team?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.25,0:00:08.91,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.91,0:00:11.00,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,By Shikyouin Hibiki?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:11.93,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.93,0:00:13.40,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.35,0:00:16.03,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I don't really want to join,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.51,0:00:19.04,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,but I'm still going to give it some thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:22.14,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,If it's something you want to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:24.38,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,you shouldn't hold yourself back on account of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.38,0:00:25.29,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.29,0:00:28.25,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Besides, it's really up to the charms.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:29.29,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.93,0:00:31.97,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.47,0:00:34.40,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,Aha!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:37.10,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,Tokuda Nene is wherever there's a big story!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:41.31,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,Toudou Sion and Houjou Sophy\Nhave been scouted for the Prodigy Team!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.31,0:00:44.02,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,This is quite the scoop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.74,0:02:17.91,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Go'ing My Way
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.95,0:02:23.11,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.11,0:02:25.41,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Sion isn't with you today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.41,0:02:27.36,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,No idea why.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:35.84,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,She's been meditating in front of her Go board all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.84,0:02:38.44,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,She seems so distant for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.44,0:02:42.89,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Good grief! Would it kill Sion to talk to us\N if she's worried about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.75,0:02:44.88,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,She didn't tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.88,0:02:45.53,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.53,0:02:46.81,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Tell us what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.81,0:02:49.23,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Shikyouin asked her...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.23,0:02:51.69,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,There you are, Houjou Sophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.69,0:02:53.36,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,So you've come!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.36,0:02:56.53,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,Could we get your current thoughts on \Nbeing scouted for the Prodigy Team?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.81,0:02:59.36,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,How does it feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.36,0:03:04.08,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,There's no way you'd turn down Hibiki's invite now that she's more popular than ever, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:05.61,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,What do you have to say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.61,0:03:06.54,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Ah, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.54,0:03:07.24,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.24,0:03:10.62,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,Why, if it isn't Dorothy and Reona of Dressing Pafé.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.62,0:03:15.84,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,Could you give us a word about Sion \Njoining that same Prodigy Team?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.31,0:03:15.84,Default-Alt,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh man...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.84,0:03:17.42,Default,Dorona,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:18.56,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,How're you feeling right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.56,0:03:20.67,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,What's going to happen to your team?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.67,0:03:23.47,Default-Alt,Nene,0,0,0,,Is there anything about Shikyouin that's got your interest?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.31,0:03:23.47,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Sion...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.47,0:03:26.26,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,was scouted for Hibiki's team?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.26,0:03:28.06,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,So that's what she's stressing over...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.06,0:03:30.57,Default,Nana,0,0,0,,Dorothy! Reona!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.52,0:03:33.62,Default,Sadako,0,0,0,,We'll get you out of there, Lady Sophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.62,0:03:35.32,Default,Sadako,0,0,0,,We'll take care of things here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.32,0:03:36.46,Default,Sadako,0,0,0,,Now get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.46,0:03:37.74,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.29,0:03:44.19,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I think you're safe here, Sophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.19,0:03:45.32,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.32,0:03:46.78,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,Ah, it's Sophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:49.42,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,You're going to join Shikyouin's team, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.42,0:03:51.01,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,,What are the rest of you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.01,0:03:52.71,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Oh, cut it out! Shut up already!
Comment: 0,0:03:53.82,0:03:57.60,Default,Goats,0,0,0,,{memememeeeeee}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.85,0:03:58.41,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.41,0:04:00.41,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,You'll be fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.66,0:04:01.84,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Fuwari?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.48,0:04:03.46,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.14,0:04:14.94,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You're returning to the Palps?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.30,0:04:19.37,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,So much has happened, and now I'm exhausted...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.37,0:04:21.15,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Even Ms. Ookanda suggested...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.15,0:04:24.49,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,That I take a short vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:27.69,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,You're welcome back whenever you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.69,0:04:31.45,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Rina and the rest of us will be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.45,0:04:34.19,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,It's Toriko's fault, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.19,0:04:35.53,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.53,0:04:38.03,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,It'd be better if Toriko wasn't here-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.03,0:04:39.11,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.11,0:04:40.84,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,If you weren't here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.84,0:04:43.61,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,who would be my manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.61,0:04:46.89,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Fuwari... Toriko loves you-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.47,0:04:48.79,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.79,0:04:52.84,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'll take in the fresh Palps air and be better in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.36,0:04:58.86,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Promise us you'll come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:06.59,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.59,0:05:08.15,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to write.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.37,0:05:12.28,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,And do your best to put on lively concerts!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.28,0:05:13.35,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.35,0:05:15.75,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Promise you'll come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.75,0:05:20.12,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,If you don't come back, \NI'm taking the rest of the coords for myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.12,0:05:21.84,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Dorothy's serious about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.19,0:05:24.07,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Take care!
Comment: 0,0:05:24.92,0:05:27.64,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{mememe meeemeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.57,0:05:32.90,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Fuwari...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.90,0:05:37.85,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,I wonder if Midorikaze actually\N enjoyed living here in Parajuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.85,0:05:39.14,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.69,0:05:44.00,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,That's does it. Shikyouin is definitely evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.00,0:05:45.82,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,It's a fact!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:48.59,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I'm totally gonna kick her butt next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.95,0:05:56.82,Default,Andou,0,0,0,,Someone must be talking about you, Master Hibiki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.75,0:05:59.49,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,No thanks. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.42,0:06:03.06,Default,Andou,0,0,0,,Miss Fuwari seems to have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.06,0:06:03.84,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.84,0:06:05.30,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Where'd she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.58,0:06:08.19,Default,Andou,0,0,0,,Back to her home in the Palps.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.50,0:06:11.52,Default,Andou,0,0,0,,It seems she plans on returning in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.83,0:06:13.09,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:15.61,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,More importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.61,0:06:19.90,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,my prodigy team is the hot topic on campus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.48,0:06:24.41,Default,Andou,0,0,0,,Shall I ask Miss Sion and Miss Sophy for their response?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.48,0:06:28.32,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,They'll eventually jump on it even if I leave them alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.04,0:06:31.87,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Prodigies are drawn to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.30,0:06:36.29,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Besides, they'll eventually grow unsatisfied\N with being amongst those of average skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.62,0:06:46.88,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,She's been like that ever since she came to PriPara-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.84,0:06:50.76,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Airy Change!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.03,0:06:56.22,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HB8F1FD&}{\i1}Gold Airy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.03,0:06:56.22,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\bord8.2\blur8.2\3c&H345195&}{\i1}Gold Airy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.34,0:07:01.08,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was fascinated by her wings despite thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.08,0:07:03.97,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'd never find anything other than black and white beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.97,0:07:06.86,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,What might you be so conflicted over?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.86,0:07:08.26,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Iroha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.26,0:07:10.80,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,I've heard this rumor:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.80,0:07:16.99,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,that someone I'm proud to call my rival has been selected to be a princess candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:20.72,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I've yet to decide if I'll do it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.72,0:07:23.88,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,Then are you saying you're quitting?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.88,0:07:27.27,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,If you don't push forward, strive to new heights,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.27,0:07:29.47,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,you'll never be able to become a Divine Idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.47,0:07:33.22,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,Or perhaps have you given up on becoming one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:33.97,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I haven't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.97,0:07:35.92,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I'm not giving up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.92,0:07:39.39,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I'm not straying from my original dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.39,0:07:42.44,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,Just what I'd expect from my rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.68,0:07:44.85,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,However, please remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.85,0:07:48.19,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,I'll be catching up to you soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.92,0:07:52.18,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Iroha...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.86,0:07:57.44,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Being that we're prodigies, a reaction unlike anything seen before will take place as we perform together.{from 74}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.44,0:08:01.75,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}And then we'll be able to witness a scene\N unlike anything anyone has ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.75,0:08:04.26,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I'll see it! I must see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.26,0:08:06.15,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,That new scenery!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.15,0:08:09.21,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I want to perform a Gold Airy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.79,0:08:11.02,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Sion...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.92,0:08:13.27,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.27,0:08:15.64,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We'll definitely win this concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.64,0:08:18.72,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Kuma, put us through the wringer!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.72,0:08:20.63,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I saw this coming-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.63,0:08:22.60,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,It's time for me to get serious-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.46,0:08:25.44,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Watch this and let's get dancin'-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:26.65,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.65,0:08:28.53,Default-Alt,Mila,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3, 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.53,0:08:30.56,Default-Alt,Mila,0,0,0,,2, 2, 3, 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.56,0:08:32.57,Default-Alt,Mila,0,0,0,,3, 2, 3, 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.57,0:08:34.84,Default-Alt,Mila,0,0,0,,4, 2, 3, 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.84,0:08:36.75,Default-Alt,Mila,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3, 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.75,0:08:38.78,Default-Alt,Mila,0,0,0,,2, 2, 3, 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.31,0:08:30.06,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Now spin four times!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.65,0:08:33.87,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Laala, you're late-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.87,0:08:36.78,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,You have to chain your movements together properly-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.78,0:08:38.78,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,And after that you lift your head and jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.78,0:08:40.62,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,C-Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.03,0:08:44.92,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Mirei, that wasn't high enough-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:45.54,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.29,0:08:49.50,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Those without talent can close the gap with effort"?{ep67}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.06,0:08:51.29,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}How callow.{ep67}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.29,0:08:54.22,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}They should stand back and allow genii to flourish.{ep67}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.22,0:08:58.39,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Miss Minami Mirei, who hasn't won a single Grand Prix.{ep73}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.35,0:09:02.17,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,That's not true-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.17,0:09:08.27,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Someone once said, \N"Genius is 1% talent and 99% percent hard work"-pri!{ep73 - slightly modified, but same quote}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.27,0:09:12.57,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll win by putting in 101%-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.57,0:09:13.56,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,That's the spirit-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.56,0:09:15.03,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Now jump-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.53,0:09:17.62,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3, 4
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.43,0:09:20.66,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.33,0:09:26.42,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That was amazing, Sophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.46,0:09:31.67,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.53,0:09:34.63,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,What can you do about it-nekon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.63,0:09:38.33,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,That 1% wall isn't something easily overcome-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.33,0:09:40.35,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I know that-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.71,0:09:46.31,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Mirei's been training harder than anyone else\N ever since she came to PriPara-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.31,0:09:49.01,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,But even with that, she still can't overcome it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.01,0:09:51.36,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,This world's not fair-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.36,0:09:54.71,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I want to help Mirei win-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.99,0:10:00.73,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Those blessed with talent are the ones who \Nreceive all of the fame and glory,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.73,0:10:04.78,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,while those who are not end up suffering-neko.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.78,0:10:07.41,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Toriko is always around when there is suffering-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.41,0:10:08.21,Default-Alt,Neko,0,0,0,,Neko?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.41,0:10:08.21,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:11.17,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,You startled me-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.17,0:10:13.04,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,You can come out and join us...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.04,0:10:15.97,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,She's been depressed since Fuwari went home-neko.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.97,0:10:20.33,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,The "to" in Toriko is for "too much trouble", \Nthe "ri" is for "risk of downsizing..."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.85,0:10:26.79,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,I've seen many idols who were hurt like that leave PriPara.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.79,0:10:30.15,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,There were also cases of idols falling into despair\N because their manager was useless-neko.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.15,0:10:32.76,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Has that happened to you as well?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.17,0:10:36.59,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Don't you know better than to delve\N into a woman's history-neko!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.59,0:10:37.99,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I'm sorry-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.99,0:10:43.53,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Toriko was an unwanted child \Nborn one stormy winter night-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.53,0:10:45.80,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,No one asked you-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.80,0:10:49.00,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,An overnight mistake...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.51,0:10:51.59,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,We can't let it end like this-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.59,0:10:53.14,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Of course-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.14,0:10:57.05,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,We'll show Hibiki how much effort Mirei,\Nthe others, and us managers are putting in-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.05,0:11:00.09,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Are we going to have a battle between\N the prodigies and hard workers-nekon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.09,0:11:01.20,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,You bet we are-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.20,0:11:04.81,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,If they're calling themselves the Prodigy Team,\N then we'll form Team Effort!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.81,0:11:06.77,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Yeah!{some kind of we got this cheer}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.44,0:11:08.51,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.43,0:11:11.08,Default,Usa,0,0,0,,Oh, Dorothy-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:12.77,Default,Usa,0,0,0,,Good timing-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.77,0:11:15.50,Default,Usa,0,0,0,,I just came up with your catchphrase-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:16.36,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Like I care!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.36,0:11:19.43,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,More importantly, Sion is... That idiot Sion is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.43,0:11:21.10,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Dorothy, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.10,0:11:22.70,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Like heck I can relax right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.03,0:11:24.16,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Usa...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.37,0:11:29.24,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I'll take you up on your offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.95,0:11:32.08,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I will join your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.69,0:11:35.54,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear that, Toudou Sion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.88,0:11:39.51,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Welcome to the prodigy team.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.43,0:11:52.10,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Decisively resolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.10,0:11:53.15,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I have no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.15,0:11:54.99,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,You're a traitor, Sion!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.99,0:11:56.10,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,A crumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.10,0:11:58.28,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,How could you team up with such a vile person?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.28,0:12:00.61,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Dorothy, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.80,0:12:00.61,Default-Alt,Dorothy,0,0,0,,How? How could you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.02,0:12:02.71,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Why're you doing this, Sion?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.71,0:12:04.57,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,It doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.49,0:12:08.89,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I'd like to see those wings once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.68,0:12:10.83,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Wings?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.17,0:12:18.54,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,That was the first time I've seen anything\N more beautiful than black or white.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.54,0:12:21.81,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I'd like to form those wings myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.81,0:12:23.52,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I believe I can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.52,0:12:25.30,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if I win or lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.64,0:12:27.08,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.08,0:12:28.39,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,That's all there is to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.39,0:12:31.17,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,That's why you joined Hibiki's team?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.17,0:12:34.03,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I don't want to regret my time here in PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.90,0:12:42.57,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Sion's going to her side.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.57,0:12:43.86,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.43,0:12:46.83,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Sion has made up her mind-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.83,0:12:50.58,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I had a feeling things would turn out like this-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.58,0:12:51.89,Default,Dorna,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.89,0:12:53.15,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Sion,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.15,0:12:57.79,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,it's my job as your manager to \Nhelp your abilities take flight-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.13,0:13:04.55,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,And I've seen idols truly shine\N once they've been set free-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.46,0:13:08.35,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I won't try to stop you-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.05,0:13:11.01,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,And if that's what the charms decide,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.63,0:13:13.66,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,make sure to follow it through to the end-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.99,0:13:16.60,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Thank you, Usagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.03,0:13:24.30,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,But!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.30,0:13:25.94,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Dorothy, relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.94,0:13:27.99,Default,Rand3,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.99,0:13:30.33,Default,Rand4,0,0,0,,Falulu's concert is starting!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.33,0:13:31.05,Default,All,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.05,0:13:32.60,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Falulu's concert?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.33,0:13:35.80,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Make haste-rubens!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.80,0:13:38.54,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Otherwise there won't be any good seats-da Vinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.90,0:13:46.47,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Can't see a thing from here-easel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.47,0:13:48.05,Default,Rand6,0,0,0,,Falulu's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.05,0:13:49.83,Default,Rand7,0,0,0,,Falulu, you're amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.83,0:13:51.39,Default,Rand8,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.86,0:13:57.31,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.02,0:13:59.89,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.95,0:14:07.79,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,PriPara's popular winter coord strikes a splendid balance\N with its warm fur and bold exposed shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.79,0:14:09.82,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Jewlery Princess Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.20,0:14:17.71,Default,Rand9,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I'm a Falulu fan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.71,0:14:19.67,Default,Rand10,0,0,0,,We're here for you, Falulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.67,0:14:22.34,Default,Rand11,0,0,0,,We love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.34,0:14:25.86,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,I'd like to announce something today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.86,0:14:29.30,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,I'm joining the princess team!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.30,0:14:31.54,Default,Rand12,0,0,0,,I love you, Falulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.05,0:14:31.54,Default2,Rand13,0,0,0,,Princess Team?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.54,0:14:33.99,Default,Rand14,0,0,0,,Think she means Prince Hibiki's prodigy team?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.99,0:14:36.14,Default,Rand13,0,0,0,,Then they're planning to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.14,0:14:37.05,Default,Rand14,0,0,0,,How wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.05,0:14:39.73,Default,Rand15,0,0,0,,Falulu really fits the image of a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.88,0:14:40.49,Default2,Rand16,0,0,0,,Lady Falulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.49,0:14:44.44,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Please listen to my "0-week-old".
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.53,0:16:17.87,Default,Falulu,0,0,90,,Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.45,0:16:32.36,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Hop!{x5}{consistency with Naisho}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.36,0:16:33.16,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Hop!{x5}{consistency with Naisho}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.16,0:16:33.76,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Hop!{x5}{consistency with Naisho}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:34.33,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Hop!{x5}{consistency with Naisho}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.33,0:16:35.62,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Hop!{x5}{consistency with Naisho}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.80,0:16:42.81,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,For all of you!{ consistency with Naisho}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.81,0:16:45.31,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Tick Tock Flower!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.57,0:16:50.70,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Airy Change!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.73,0:16:57.91,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HB8F1FD&}Gold Airy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.73,0:16:57.91,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,{\bord8.2\blur8.2\3c&H345195&}Gold Airy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.98,0:17:27.56,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm going to achieve that as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.91,0:17:29.37,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.37,0:17:30.90,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I want to do that, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.77,0:17:51.88,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You want to join her team, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.38,0:17:55.42,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,No, I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.42,0:17:56.60,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Sophy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.60,0:18:00.14,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'd love to see what you're like when you're free.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.82,0:18:03.93,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,I feel the same-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.39,0:18:07.10,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Laala...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.10,0:18:08.35,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Mirei...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.70,0:18:11.85,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry about us-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.85,0:18:14.32,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Stay honest to your feelings-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.74,0:18:17.42,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Your freedom is what's most important!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.42,0:18:20.28,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We know that better than anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.24,0:18:25.70,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Well said, you two-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.19,0:18:28.29,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Sophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.96,0:18:30.75,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,It's best that way-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.71,0:18:36.02,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,I can see perfectly from her-enoir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.02,0:18:39.43,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Too bad the concert is already Michel Angel-over-odin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.43,0:18:40.39,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Vinci?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.39,0:18:41.68,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Get her out of here, Andou!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:43.23,Default,Andou,0,0,0,,Yes, Master Hibiki, right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.55,0:18:45.64,Default2,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Vinci?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.94,0:18:47.10,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Vinci?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.56,0:18:49.45,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,What are you doing-rubens?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.45,0:18:51.72,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Luna Warwick Ruso-DaVinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.34,0:18:53.96,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Owwowow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.96,0:18:55.29,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,DaVinci.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.29,0:18:56.86,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,That face of hers...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.30,0:19:00.32,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,I swear I've seen it somewhere before-daVinci.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.65,0:19:05.21,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Get going, Sion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.37,0:19:10.58,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,You realize that we probably can't \Nkeep our team the way it is now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.58,0:19:13.83,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,She wants you to do what you want, Sion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.05,0:19:17.50,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,But it's most unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.50,0:19:19.03,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,We're gonna be the ones who win.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.03,0:19:24.66,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,'Sides, that haphazard prodigy team'll\N fall apart just like okonomiyaki without batter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.66,0:19:26.89,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Don't end up regretting it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.72,0:19:29.62,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,It'll be fair and square!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.62,0:19:32.10,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Let's perform as rivals without regrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.99,0:19:41.12,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,They're wonderful-nekon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.12,0:19:42.88,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Of course they are-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.88,0:19:45.70,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Those idols are my pride and joy-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.67,0:19:52.83,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:54.51,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.51,0:19:57.44,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,You came to tell me you'd join my team,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.44,0:19:59.67,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,but ran out of energy partway here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.26,0:20:02.67,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.64,0:20:07.72,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I welcome you, Houjou Sophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.34,0:20:11.32,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.10,0:20:18.57,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,All right, don't you dare lose in the upcoming \NTeam Effort vs Team Prodigy showdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.57,0:20:20.08,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,I'll put 101%...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.08,0:20:24.70,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,No, I'll put 102% effort into it to make sure we win-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.36,0:20:27.56,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,You need to work on your balance first-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.91,0:20:31.62,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Things aren't looking pretty-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.89,0:20:39.00,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Just one to go...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.57,0:22:17.93,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Christmas is full of fun things-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.93,0:22:19.21,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.21,0:22:22.58,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Anko and Miruku are moving away from each other..
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.58,0:22:23.81,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.81,0:22:26.07,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,There'll be a Christmas miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.07,0:22:26.84,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.84,0:22:29.53,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Happy Bye-bye Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.53,0:22:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,
